{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NvoDk3xX6H1793634591.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐洲至少七個國家超市製冷設備遭受網絡攻擊。</p><p></p><p>英國傳媒報道，瑞典有連鎖超市門店表示，其冷藏和冷凍設備的溫度被人為設置為攝氏50度。瑞典網絡安全部門著手調查。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.EURO.HACK-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vx59Yyq0371793634580.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在愛沙尼亞，傳媒引述一家製冷設備供應商稱，當地一家連鎖超市受到類似攻擊，製冷設備溫度被設置為攝氏50度。</p><p></p><p>報道指瑞典、愛爾蘭，比利時、盧森堡和愛沙尼亞等歐洲國家的多間超市，受到網絡攻擊，導致冷藏和冷凍設備溫度異常升高，部分食品變質，是繼上月法國數百家超市遭到類似攻擊後，歐洲再次出現針對超市製冷系統的網絡攻擊事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.285985+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T15:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:58:41.137692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:28.774849+00:00","content_hash":"9ef90b7212097f661fb42da483459fb8a8a8c3e23292b980fc03eca472a25216","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.285985+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}